  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG-20140819-WA0000.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 270px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; line-height: 21.33333396911621px;\">El Raval de Villamalur ha vivido con intensidad sus fiestas durante este pasado y largo fin de semana, con un programa fundamentalmente a base de comidas y cenas, pero tambi&eacute;n con un espect&aacute;culo de variedades, protagonizado por vecinos, vecinas y visitantes.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasravalvillamalur14/img-20140819-wa0000.jpg\" alt=\"img-20140819-wa0000\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasravalvillamalur14/img-20140819-wa0001.jpg\" alt=\"img-20140819-wa0001\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasravalvillamalur14/img-20140819-wa0002.jpg\" alt=\"img-20140819-wa0002\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasravalvillamalur14/img-20140819-wa0003.jpg\" alt=\"img-20140819-wa0003\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasravalvillamalur14/img-20140819-wa0004.jpg\" alt=\"img-20140819-wa0004\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasravalvillamalur14/img-20140819-wa0005.jpg\" alt=\"img-20140819-wa0005\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasravalvillamalur14/img-20140819-wa0006.jpg\" alt=\"img-20140819-wa0006\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiesta